Project Mu: no sync promo on History, no coloured accents at all

  * History never shows "See your history on other devices / Sync history".
    Mu has no sign-in or sync, and keeps no history by default (0002).
  * Patch 0010 turned the primary palette grey; the secondary and tertiary
    palettes still tinted tonal button outlines (Details / Remove on the
    Extensions page), chips and tonal containers blue-green. Map them to the
    neutral tone of the same lightness too, so Mu's UI is ink, grey and washi
    with the inkan red as its only colour.

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/history/browsing_history_handler.cc b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/history/browsing_history_handler.cc
index 2ca7d2b..fce7a81 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/history/browsing_history_handler.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/history/browsing_history_handler.cc
@@ -756,7 +756,10 @@ void BrowsingHistoryHandler::ShouldShowHistoryPageHistorySyncPromo(
     return;
   }
 
-  std::move(callback).Run(true);
+  // Project Mu: never show the "See your history on other devices / Sync
+  // history" promo. Mu has no sign-in or sync, and keeps no history by
+  // default (patch 0002).
+  std::move(callback).Run(false);
 }
 
